---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pocketey Games — Small adventures, one more try" description="Two original free browser action games. Three short stages each, touch and keyboard controls, no account needed.">
<section class="arcade container"><p class="kicker">POCKETEY ORIGINALS / 01—02</p><h1>A little escape.<br/><em>One more try.</em></h1><p class="intro">短い冒険を、ポケットに。<br/>タップで遊べる、2つの小さな3Dアクション。</p><div class="game-grid">
<a class="game-card orbit-card" href="/games/orbit-ribbon/"><div class="art orbit-art"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>↗</b></div><div class="card-copy"><span>01 / RUN & JUMP</span><h2>Orbit Ribbon</h2><p>星のあいだを、駆け抜ける。<br/>よけて、跳んで、軌道の先へ。</p><strong>PLAY NOW <span>↗</span></strong></div></a>
<a class="game-card amber-card" href="/games/amber-step/"><div class="art amber-art"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>↗</b></div><div class="card-copy"><span>02 / MOVE & JUMP</span><h2>Amber Step</h2><p>小さな一歩で、空を渡ろう。<br/>琥珀色の足場をつなぐ冒険。</p><strong>PLAY NOW <span>↗</span></strong></div></a>
</div><p class="footnote">各3ステージ · タッチ / キーボード · 音はオプション<br/>アカウント不要。進行状況と自己ベストは、このブラウザに保存されます。</p><p class="footnote">WebGL対応ブラウザが必要です。動作は端末により異なります。</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.arcade{padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:70px}.kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--muted)}h1{font:500 clamp(44px,7vw,80px)/1.04 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:24px 0}h1 em{color:#4b8276;font-weight:400}.intro{font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:40px}.game-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.game-card{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border:1px solid #ffffff15;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#141e34;color:#edf7f4;transition:transform .2s}.game-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}.amber-card{background:#30253b;color:#fff0dc}.art{height:230px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 65% 15%,#33576e,transparent 60%),#131c32}.art:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#fff9 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:43px 41px;opacity:.2}.art i{position:absolute;display:block;width:42%;height:110px;background:#488596;border:3px solid #8ee9d0;transform:rotate(-26deg) skewX(25deg);top:190px;left:12%;box-shadow:0 13px #29445c}.art i:nth-child(2){top:60px;left:34%;width:30%;height:90px}.art i:nth-child(3){top:-28px;left:54%;width:22%;height:62px}.art b{position:absolute;left:49%;top:104px;display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:40px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff0dc;color:#254655;transform:rotate(-10deg);box-shadow:6px 8px #172b45}.amber-art{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 15%,#735561,transparent 60%),#30253b}.amber-art i{width:31%;height:30px;left:4%;top:180px;transform:skewY(-8deg);border-color:#ffd598;background:#aa7963;box-shadow:0 20px #624f64}.amber-art i:nth-child(2){left:39%;top:133px;width:25%;height:30px}.amber-art i:nth-child(3){left:70%;top:85px;width:25%;height:30px}.amber-art b{top:85px;left:48%}.card-copy{padding:28px}.card-copy>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#b1d6d1}.card-copy h2{font:500 34px/1.2 system-ui;margin:12px 0;letter-spacing:-.04em}.card-copy p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;opacity:.75}.card-copy strong{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:24px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff26}.footnote{font-size:11px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin-top:24px}@media(max-width:650px){.arcade{padding-top:36px}.game-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.art{height:210px}.card-copy{padding:24px}.intro{margin-bottom:26px}}
</style>
